    "text": "No hat tips, bro — but I do wonder why I’ve been so lucky. 🤷🏽‍♂️\nI have a friend who talks about driving back to Colorado Springs from someplace east when he was active-duty Air Force, and everybody in the car fell asleep — including the driver. They woke up in the middle of a corn field, mowing down the corn plants at 70 mph. 😂\nThat’s the one that impresses me the most. There are so many things they could’ve hit, and they dodged all of them.",
